'''Diabrollow''' (ツバサターン, ''Tsubasatān'', '''Tsubasaturn''') is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]]/[[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] variant of [[Brollow]] introduced in [[Resort De La Cospa]]. It was added in [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]].

